SARIF:      "failed": 1,
SARIF:      "verified": 2
SARIF:      "results": [
The compiler's warning, its notes as related locations.
SARIF:      "kind": "fail",
SARIF-NEXT: "level": "warning",
SARIF:      "text": "using the result of an assignment as a condition without parentheses"
SARIF:      "option": "-Wparentheses",
